The '''Station Cash Marketplace''' was an in-game shop that uses [[Station Cash]], an in-game currency.

==Station Cash Prices==
{{Main|Station Cash}}
The [[wikipedia:Real world money|money]] value on [[Station Cash]] is equivalent to {{SC|100}} = $1 [[wikipedia:United States dollar|United States dollar]]. Station Cash is available for purchase through transaction on the official ''[[Free Realms]]'' website in the following denominations:
*$5.00 - {{SC|500}}
*$10.00 - {{SC|1000}}
*$20.00 - {{SC|2000}}
*$25.00 - {{SC|2500}}
*$45.00 - {{SC|5000}}
*$85.00 - {{SC|10000}}

==Sunset Sale==
[[File:Sunsetsale.jpg|thumb|Advertisement image]]
From January 28 through March 17, 2014, prices on all SC Marketplace items were dropped to 60% of their regular price in response to the announced closure of ''Free Realms'' on January 24, 2014. The closure, also known as the [[Sunset of Free Realms]] is scheduled to take place on March 31, 2014.

On March 18, 2014, prices on Marketplace items dropped to {{SC|1}}.

